                          "text": [
                            "Pip has inherited\na desk with your\ngarage. The desk\nhas inherited a",
                            "complaint. Every\nwinter, Frostwick\npays to thaw the\nsame pipe. This",
                            "year the city\nplans to sell the\nwhole network\ninstead. Pip asks\nfor",
                            "one useful fact\nbefore anyone\nsigns anything."
